 "authority": "OD-32 (G1). Pinned by SHA-256 in VAN_NEXT_OWNER_DECISIONS_REV1.md, section 'Locked contracts'. A change to this file is a change to the approved transition relation and needs the owner's re-approval of the new hash.",
 "semantics": "Each entry permits exactly one (machine, from, to) transition. 'guards' is an AND set: every listed proof type is required, and nothing else is accepted. An empty list means the transition needs no proof (cancellations, expiries, requests). The model may not contain any transition, or any guard set, that is not listed here; and every listed transition must be present in the model.",
